Apple ld does not implement GNU --wrap. For the snapshot fixture only, the adapter redirects the three remote_backend.c cross-TU calls to existing __wrap_ functions and binds harness __real_ references to unchanged production definitions. No assertions or function bodies are removed.
The adapter rejects unknown wrap symbols/source lists. Both 100/300ms and O0/O2 matrices are executed.
