verify.sh all now explicitly propagates a failing host phase. Full host completion is additionally checked via its completion marker.
The trim-key fixture defines trims_input as constant zero. A temporary PATH c++ adapter disables only Clang -Wconstant-logical-operand for mower-trim-lock-*/keys.cpp. Other C++ and ARM builds retain flags.
